      <key>com.lihbr.kuronuri.source</key>
      <string>Drawn, one script stroke that crosses itself: Redaction Italic a's bowl, its top stroke turning down, thick, into a stem that ends in a's tail, its bottom stroke going up, thin, through that stem to a small ball at the x-height, as x's: the stroke over its top, x's step under the stroke, the ball over its side bearing as x's is; x's notches where they cross, cut along the thin stroke into the thick one</string>
